sed. reads like a case docket — and works as literal UI state labels","name":"Wordmark & tagline"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-elevation.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"OKLCH steps off the two locked darks — elevation by lightness, never shadow bloom","name":"Elevation ramp"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-gold-rule.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Gold appears on exactly two element types: citation chips and the statutory clock","name":"Evidence-gold binding"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-locked.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Five fixed sRGB hexes — never gamut-widened, never re-themed","name":"Locked brand values"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-severity.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Shape glyph + printed label + color, always together — never hue alone","name":"Severity ramp"},{"path":"components/actions/buttons.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Primary / approve / deny / secondary / ghost — display-face caps, one accent per surface","name":"Buttons"},{"path":"components/evidence/evidence.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"CitationChip · Provenance · LogWell · QuarantineWell","name":"Evidence set"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"Input (mono option) · Select · Switch — fields sit in a well, never raised","name":"Form controls"},{"path":"components/indicators/severity.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Shape + label + color, discriminable in grayscale","name":"Severity badges"},{"path":"components/instruments/instruments.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x330","subtitle":"StatutoryClock · StateChain · Sparkline","name":"Instruments"},{"path":"ui_kits/console/index.html","group":"Console","viewport":"1440x830","subtitle":"Interactive: overview, alert queue, glass-box replay, action center, append-only audit log","